: none;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">$3.50</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 208px; padding: 0in 7px 0in 7px; border-top: none; border-right: 1px solid black; border-left: 1px solid black;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">Table tennis</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 208px; padding: 0in 7px 0in 7px; border-top: none; border-right: 1px solid black; border-left: none;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">free</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 208px; padding: 0in 7px 0in 7px; border-top: none; border-right: 1px solid black; border-left: none;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">free</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 208px; padding: 0in 7px 0in 7px; border-top: none; border-right: 1px solid black; border-left: 1px solid black;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">Pool table</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 208px; padding: 0in 7px 0in 7px; border-top: none; border-right: 1px solid black; border-left: none;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">free</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 208px; padding: 0in 7px 0in 7px; border-top: none; border-right: 1px solid black; border-left: none;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">free</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">Hours</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">Monday - Friday 6:00 a.m. -10:00 p.m.</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\">Saturday and Sunday 7:00 a.m. - 6:00 p.m.</span></span></span></p>","transcriptHtml":"","explanationHtml":"","questions":[{"num":176,"stem":"What can be inferred about Ms. Blamires?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"She requested some information."},{"choice":"B","text":"She is a member of Bestest Fitness."},{"choice":"C","text":"She works at Bestest Fitness."},{"choice":"D","text":"She sent a letter of complaint."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"<p>Dựa vào thông tin:&nbsp;<em>\"Bestest Fitness has been providing our members the best environment for more than 15 years.\", \"we have approximately 60,000 members all over Australia and we are very proud to say that our program is perfectly designed to fulfill our members' needs on a daily basis.\", \"Our experienced and qualified instructors can give you advice on the best fitness program by having a counseling session.\"</em></p>\n<p>=&gt; Có thể suy ra rằng cô Blamires đã hỏi một số thông tin về Bestest Fitness cũng như chương trình thể hình của nó. Ngoài ra còn có thông tin \"Để biết thêm chi tiết, vui lòng xem tài liệu đính kèm. Nếu bạn có thắc mắc, hãy để lại email cho chúng tôi tại info(a)bestest.com\" <strong>=&gt; A đúng</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Câu hỏi suy luận"]},{"num":177,"stem":"In the letter, the word “arranged” in paragraph 2, line 4, is closest in meaning to","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"settled"},{"choice":"B","text":"run"},{"choice":"C","text":"installed"},{"choice":"D","text":"inaugurated"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"<p>(A) settled: giải quyết&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>(B) run: chạy</p>\n\n<p>(C) installed: c&agrave;i đặt</p>\n\n<p>(D) inaugurated: kh&aacute;nh th&agrave;nh</p>\n\n<p>Dựa v&agrave;o nghĩa của từ</p>\n\n<p><strong>=&gt; Chọn B</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Từ vựng đồng nghĩa"]},{"num":178,"stem":"What did Ms. Blamires receive with the letter?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"A coupon"},{"choice":"B","text":"A pamphlet"},{"choice":"C","text":"A membership card"},{"choice":"D","text":"A counseling sheet"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"<p>Thông tin:&nbsp;<em>\"For more details, please see the&nbsp;<strong>enclosed brochure</strong>.\"&nbsp;</em><em>=&gt;&nbsp;A pamphlet</em></p>\n<p><strong>=&gt; Chọn đáp án B</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Tìm thông tin chi tiết"]},{"num":179,"stem":"Which of the following is NOT mentioned about Bestest Fitness?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"There are qualified and experienced instructors."},{"choice":"B","text":"It costs 2 dollars for an adult to use the gym for an hour."},{"choice":"C","text":"They help each member select the best program."},{"choice":"D","text":"They have a large number of members worldwide."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"<p>Ta có các thông tin:</p>\n<p><em>\"Our<strong>&nbsp;experienced and qualified instructors</strong>&nbsp;can give you advice on the best fitness program by having a counseling session.\"&nbsp;</em><strong>=&gt; Loại A</strong></p>\n<p>Look at the table, we can see that it costs $2.00 for an adult to use the gym for an hour.&nbsp;<strong>=&gt; Loại B</strong></p>\n<p><em>\"Our experienced and qualified instructors can give you advice on the best fitness program by having a counseling session.\"&nbsp;</em><strong>=&gt; Loại C</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Câu hỏi NOT / TRUE"]},{"num":180,"stem":"When is a suitable time for Ms. Blamires to call Bestest Fitness?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"Monday 5:00 A.M."},{"choice":"B","text":"Tuesday 7:00 P.M."},{"choice":"C","text":"Saturday 6:30 A.M."},{"choice":"D","text":"Sunday 7:30 P.M."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"<p><strong>Thông tin:</strong> \"The working hours of Bestest Fitness is Monday - Friday 6:00 a.m. -10:00 p.m. &amp; Saturday and Sunday 7:00 a.m. - 6:00 p.m\".</p>\n<p><strong>=&gt; Loại A, C &amp; D</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Tìm thông tin chi tiết"]}]},{"part":7,"range":"181-185","audio":null,"images":[],"passageHtml":"<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">To: Petrisha Deaze&lt;petrisha9@financialconsult.com&gt;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">From: Steven Hernandez&lt;merrysteven@atcmulti.com&gt;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Re: Phone conversation</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Date: Monday, October 26</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Dear Ms. Deaze,</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">I am writing to you to apologize for the inconvenience we had on the telephone just before. As you noticed, the conference call switch on my phone was acting up and several outside conversations interrupted us. I’m afraid that we may have lost or miscommunicated some important information at the end of conversation.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">I know that you were talking about the value of the WebWide and IntelCom stocks we inquired about three days ago. However, I could not hear any more than that.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Our phones are still acting strange, so if it is possible, would you please fax me the information today? I would very much appreciate it.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Sincerely,</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Steven Hernandez</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">_______________________________________________</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">To: Steven Hemandez&lt;merrysteven@atcmulti.com&gt;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">From: Petrisha Deaze&lt;petrisha9@financialconsult.com&gt;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Date: October 26</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Re: Phone conversation and correction</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Dear Mr. Hernandez,</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Thank you for your e-mail. It is true our communication did not go as smoothly as I had hoped during our call, but please do not worry about it. I understand that office equipment does break down at inconvenient times.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">I called to inform you that two of the stock prices I faxed you last Friday were inaccurate. WebWide should be 1150.5 not 1155.5 and IntelCom should be 930.25 not 935.25.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">I should have faxed the corrected data, but, unfortunately, our fax machine broke down yesterday morning and the replacement ordered hasn’t arrived yet. We both happened to have technical problems in our offices.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">If you have any questions, please contact me anytime at the above e-mail address or by fax after Wednesday, the 28th. Once again, thank you for your concern.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Sincerely yours,</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span><span style=\"line-height:107%\">Petrisha Deaze</span></span></span></p>","transcriptHtml":"","explanationHtml":"","questions":[{"num":181,"stem":"What is the purpose of Mr. Hernandez’s e-mail?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"To set up a conference call"},{"choice":"B","text":"To explain why his fax didn’t arrive"},{"choice":"C","text":"To apologize for an inconvenience"},{"choice":"D","text":"To ask Ms. Deaze to buy some stocks"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"<p>Thông tin:&nbsp;<em>\"I am writing to you to <strong>apologize for the inconvenience</strong> we had on the telephone just before.\"</em></p>\n<p><strong>=&gt; Chọn C</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Câu hỏi ý chính / Mục đích"]},{"num":182,"stem":"What has disturbed their conversation?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"Failure of the phone"},{"choice":"B","text":"Some equipment going out"},{"choice":"C","text":"The power outage"},{"choice":"D","text":"The street noise"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"<p>Thông tin:&nbsp;<em>\"As you noticed, the conference call switch on my phone was acting up and several outside conversations interrupted us.\"&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p><strong>=&gt; Chọn B</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Tìm thông tin chi tiết"]},{"num":183,"stem":"Why didn’t Ms. Deaze fax the information?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"Her fax machine was out of order."},{"choice":"B","text":"She didn’t have the correct fax number."},{"choice":"C","text":"She was too busy."},{"choice":"D","text":"She forgot to send it."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"<p><strong>Thông tin:</strong>&nbsp;<em>\"I should have faxed the corrected data, but, unfortunately, our&nbsp;<strong>fax machine broke down&nbsp;</strong>yesterday morning\"&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p><strong>break down = out of order: hư hỏng</strong></p>\n<p><strong>=&gt; chon A</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Tìm thông tin chi tiết"]},{"num":184,"stem":"In the second e-mail, the word “concern” in paragraph 4, line 2, is closest in meaning to","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"worry"},{"choice":"B","text":"insecurity"},{"choice":"C","text":"interest"},{"choice":"D","text":"anxiety"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"<p>Trong e-mail thứ hai, từ “<strong>concern</strong>” ở đoạn 4, dòng 2, gần nghĩa nhất với:</p>\n<p>(A) worry: lo lắng</p>\n<p>(B) insecurity: bất an</p>\n<p>(C) interest: quan tâm</p>\n<p>(D) anxiety: lo lắng</p>\n<p><strong>concern: bận tâm, quan tâm = interest</strong></p>\n<p><strong>=&gt; chọn C</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Từ vựng đồng nghĩa"]},{"num":185,"stem":"When did Ms. Deaze fax Mr. Hernandez the wrong information?","options":[{"choice":"A","text":"October 23"},{"choice":"B","text":"October 26"},{"choice":"C","text":"October 27"},{"choice":"D","text":"October 28"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"<p>Trong e-mail thứ hai có thông tin&nbsp;<em>\"I called to inform you that two of the stock prices&nbsp;<strong>I faxed you last Friday were inaccurate</strong>.\" nghĩa là </em>\"Tôi gọi điện để thông báo với bạn rằng hai giá cổ phiếu mà tôi đã fax cho bạn vào thứ Sáu tuần trước là không chính xác.\" Trong khi đó, nhìn vào e-mail đầu tiên, chúng ta có thể thấy e-mail được gửi vào thứ Hai, ngày 26 tháng 10. =&gt; Thứ Sáu tuần trước là ngày 23 tháng 10. <strong>=&gt; A đúng</strong></p>","tags":["[Part 7] Tìm thông tin chi tiết"]}]}],"focusPart":7,"subLabel":"Đoạn kép"}